		<article class="post-content">
			<section class="post-title-wrap cf post-title-wrap-no-image">
				<h2 class="post-title"><a href="https://legacy.utcourts.gov/utc/notices/2024/07/31/estate-ghttps-legacy-utcourts-gov-utc-notices-wp-admin-post-new-phpuardianship-of-minor-blaine-douglas-austin-stephanie-lyn-meikle-austin-243100119/">ESTATE/GUARDIANSHIP OF MINOR-  BLAINE DOUGLAS AUSTIN &amp; STEPHANIE LYN MEIKLE AUSTIN 243100119</a></h2>
			</section>

			
			
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">FORMAL PROBATE scheduled on August 29, 2024 at 03:00 PM with Judge BRIAN CANNELL<br /><br />This hearing will not take place at the courthouse. It will be conducted remotely.<br /><br />Hearing Link: <br />https://utcourts.webex.com/utcourts/j.php?MTID=m29193772d085000a5ed2d37dc8d1277b<br /><br />Attorney:<br />Matthew Wood &#8211; MATTHEW@9THSOUTHLAW.COM<br />Lieberman Siebers Wood &#8211; Utah County Office<br />2301 N Hillcrest Rd<br />Saratoga Springs, UT 84045<br /><br />Contact the court to provide your current email address.<br />If you do not have access to a phone or other electronic device to appear remotely, notify the court.<br /><br />For up-to-date information on court operations during the COVID-19 pandemic, please visit:<br />https://www.utcourts.gov/alerts/</p>
		</article>
		
